{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲把前段的疲惫、仍未消退的牵挂和无法挽回的限制连成了“想靠近—逐步聚力—反复受压”的因果主线，也解释了柔软的向往如何从被动承受转为推动行动的力量；但它对开头为何仍然试探、每次发力为何产生新的压力，以及前进如何反过来松动停滞，多以概括性判断带过，身体先于念头的反应和应对方式改变感受的过程都不够具体。 \",\n    \"乙\": \"乙具体解释了缺乏回应保证如何先引发身体停顿、压低期待为何不能消除靠近的愿望、前一次用力留下的余压如何进入下一轮，以及反复紧绷如何使末尾的前进成为越来越难以抑制的动作倾向，并说明行动带来的松动不等于紧张解除；不足之处是个别从身体消耗推到犹疑逐渐耗尽的因果仍属心理推演，而 H/M 标签本身并不能增加解释力。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙不仅说明了害怕仍在时为何仍会前进，还把身体停顿、压力累积、期待无法撤回与末尾行动倾向连成了更具体的动态机制，虽然部分推演并非听感唯一支持的解释，但整体上没有牺牲甲对柔软转为意志、紧张中仍有松动的把握。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "68beacfb-7948-4dce-871f-c9a243f8a410", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134412940339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:45:14.204288+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "515bde0f8bf13f4b4394670db45e4da890751bfe4fc46d68f043f27915ad26f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3